# Each line added to this file on main runs the "Backfill follow counts"
# workflow (.github/workflows/backfill-follow-counts.yml) once, for every
# account, as Actions → Run workflow does. Add a dated line saying why; the
# workflow's run on that commit is its record. A count is stored only if it
# was read after the one already there, so a second request is harmless.
